{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]舒服，舒服得很。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]在自卫团能活动的地方有限，总有种舒展不开筋骨的感觉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]当然我可不是觉得自卫团不好，毕竟自卫团的扎营空间要考虑实用，这是皮塔大哥说的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]老大这里就不一样，空间宽敞得很，可以尽情活动。就算是用石磨练举重也不需要担心伤到人。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]嗯？我为什么总在锻炼肌肉？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]我小时候——啊，我是说来到巴诺姆村之前——曾经被一个佣兵团收养。说是收养，其实是被当做苦力——或者说是奴隶养着。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]干活慢了就要挨打，还经常没饭吃，晚上只能睡在驮兽的圈里。在那种生活条件下，身体根本长不起来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]当时我不止一次想要离开，他们给我的条件是，只要能打过他们其中任何一个人，就放我走。但那时候的我一丁点腱子肉都长不起来，当然也没可能打得过他们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]虽然之后我好不容易逃了出来……但从那之后，为了不再被任何人欺负，我一天都没停下过锻炼自己。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]所以在任何地方都不忘锻炼，渐渐也成了一种习惯了吧。啊哈哈哈哈。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"卡夫-在这里住的还舒服吗？","script":"sj_023_02"}